"text":"strucåon)은","x":302,"y":937,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"오직","x":489,"y":937,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":560,"y":937,"width":53,"height":35},{"text":"모드에서만","x":624,"y":937,"width":145,"height":35},{"text":"수행되고,","x":778,"y":937,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제만","x":915,"y":937,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"커널","x":1082,"y":937,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"모드에서","x":1155,"y":937,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"수행되기","x":1300,"y":937,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"때문","x":1445,"y":937,"width":61,"height":34}]},{"text":"이다. 이러한 기법은 운영체제만 레지스터들의 값을 변경할 수 있도록 허가해 줌으로써","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":304,"y":993,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":386,"y":994,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"기법은","x":487,"y":995,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제만","x":583,"y":995,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"레지스터들의","x":740,"y":995,"width":171,"height":35},{"text":"값을","x":928,"y":995,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"변경할","x":1001,"y":996,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1106,"y":996,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":1155,"y":995,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"허가해","x":1267,"y":995,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"줌으로써","x":1379,"y":995,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"사\u0026자 프로그램이 레지스터의 내용을 변경하는 것을 막는다.","words":[{"text":"사\u0026자","x":304,"y":1052,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램이","x":404,"y":1054,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"레지스터의","x":560,"y":1054,"width":139,"height":35},{"text":"내용을","x":714,"y":1054,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"변경하는","x":811,"y":1053,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"것을","x":940,"y":1054,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"막는다.","x":1010,"y":1054,"width":100,"height":35}]},{"text":"커널 모드에서 수행되는 운영체제는 운영체제 메모리 영역과 사용자 메모리 영역의","words":[{"text":"커널","x":362,"y":1111,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"모드에서","x":431,"y":1113,"width":112,"height":35},{"text":"수행되는","x":557,"y":1112,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":683,"y":1112,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제","x